{
  "category": "Beckon Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "DUSCLOPS’s body is completely hollow - there is nothing at all inside. It is said that its body is like a black hole. This POKéMON will absorb anything into its body, but nothing will ever come back out.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "DUSCLOPS absorbs anything, however large the object may be. This POKéMON hypnotizes its foe by waving its hands in a macabre manner and by bringing its single eye to bear. The hypnotized foe is made to do DUSCLOPS’s bidding.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is thought that its body is hollow with only a spectral ball of fire burning inside. However, no one has been able to confirm this theory as fact.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
